<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>李焕鹏 · 个人简历</title>
<!--
  ============================================================
  李焕鹏 个人求职网站 · 单文件版（清新蓝 · AI 紫 · 惊艳交互版）
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  参考 Brittany Chiang / Adham Dannaway / Sean Halpin / Locomotive 等
  个人简历站的设计语言，重制视觉与交互：
  · 自定义光标（光点 + 延迟环）            · 顶部滚动进度条
  · Hero 极光网格 + 渐变发光大标题 + 头像旋转光环/脉冲光晕
  · 卡片：光标追踪光晕 + 3D 倾斜 + 扫光     · 错落入场动画
  · 开源项目改为「痛点/做法/结果」案例式     · 技能跑马灯
  全部零依赖、无构建；支持 prefers-reduced-motion 与移动端降级。
  ============================================================
-->
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#f4f8ff;--bg-soft:#eaf1ff;--bg-deep:#e3edff;
    --primary:#2f6df6;--primary-dark:#1e4fd0;--primary-light:#5b8def;--accent:#7dd3fc;
    --ai:#7c5cff;--ai-soft:#efeaff;--ai-deep:#5b3fd6;
    --text:#1b2540;--muted:#66729a;
    --card:#ffffff;--border:#e3ecff;
    --shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(47,109,246,.12);--shadow-sm:0 5px 16px rgba(47,109,246,.09);
    --radius:20px;--ease:cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
  body{font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei","Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.75;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
  a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
  ::selection{background:rgba(124,92,255,.25)}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
  section{padding:88px 0}
  .sec-title{font-size:30px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;letter-spacing:-.5px}
  .sec-title .dot{width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(47,109,246,.14)}
  .sec-title .grad{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
  .sec-sub{color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:38px;font-size:15px;max-width:640px}
  .ai-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ai);background:var(--ai-soft);padding:3px 11px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:6px;vertical-align:middle}

  /* ===== Scroll progress bar ===== */
  .progress{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;height:3px;width:0;z-index:200;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--primary),var(--ai),#22d3ee);box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(124,92,255,.6)}

  /* ===== Custom cursor ===== */
  .cursor-dot,.cursor-ring{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;mix-blend-mode:screen;opacity:0;transition:opacity .3s}
  .cursor-dot{width:7px;height:7px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 10px 2px var(--ai)}
  .cursor-ring{width:38px;height:38px;border:1.5px solid rgba(124,92,255,.7);transition:width .25s var(--ease),height .25s var(--ease),border-color .25s,opacity .3s}
  .cursor-ring.hover{width:62px;height:62px;border-color:rgba(47,109,246,.9);background:rgba(47,109,246,.06)}

  /* ===== Reveal ===== */
  .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(34px);transition:opacity .8s var(--ease),transform .8s var(--ease)}
  .reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
  .stagger > *{transition-delay:calc(var(--i,0)*70ms)}

  /* ===== Nav ===== */
  nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:80;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:64px}
  .logo{font-weight:900;font-size:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;cursor:pointer}
  .nav-links{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .nav-links a{padding:8px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);transition:.25s var(--ease);position:relative}
  .nav-links a:hover{background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--primary)}
  .nav-links a.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-dark));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(47,109,246,.32)}
  .menu-btn{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;padding:8px;cursor:pointer}
  .menu-btn span{display:block;width:24px;height:2.5px;background:var(--primary-dark);border-radius:2px;transition:.25s var(--ease)}
  .menu-btn.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7.5px) rotate(45deg)}
  .menu-btn.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
  .menu-btn.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7.5px) rotate(-45deg)}
  .mobile-menu{position:fixed;inset:60px 0 auto 0;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(20,40,80,.12);display:none;flex-direction:column;padding:12px 18px 18px;z-index:99;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
  .mobile-menu.show{display:flex}
  .mobile-menu a{padding:13px 16px;border-radius:12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);transition:.2s}
  .mobile-menu a:hover{background:var(--bg-soft);color:var(--primary)}

  /* ===== Hero ===== */
  .hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 80% -10%,rgba(124,92,255,.18),transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 0% 110%,rgba(47,109,246,.18),transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(135deg,#eef4ff 0%,#e2ecff 50%,#d8e6ff 100%)}
  .hero .grid-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;
      background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(47,109,246,.06) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(47,109,246,.06) 1px,transparent 1px);
      background-size:46px 46px;
      -webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#000,transparent 75%);
      mask-image:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%,#000,transparent 75%)}
  .hero .blob{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(80px);opacity:.55;z-index:0;animation:aurora 18s ease-in-out infinite}
  .hero .b1{width:560px;height:560px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#7c5cff,transparent 62%);top:-180px;left:-120px}
  .hero .b2{width:520px;height:520px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#2f6df6,transparent 62%);bottom:-200px;right:-100px;animation-delay:-6s}
  .hero .b3{width:420px;height:420px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#22d3ee,transparent 62%);top:30%;left:55%;animation-delay:-11s;opacity:.4}
  @keyframes aurora{0%,100%{transform:translate(0,0) scale(1)}50%{transform:translate(60px,40px) scale(1.18)}}
  .hero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;min-height:88vh;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px}
  .hero-left{will-change:transform;transition:transform .2s ease-out}
  .hero h1{font-size:54px;line-height:1.08;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px}
  .hero h1 .hi{display:block;background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--primary),var(--ai) 55%,#22d3ee);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 18px rgba(124,92,255,.28))}
  .hero h1 .name{font-size:60px}
  .hero .role{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;padding:7px 17px;border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--primary);font-weight:800;font-size:15px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .hero .badge-ai{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px;margin-left:10px;padding:7px 17px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ai),#a78bfa);color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(124,92,255,.34)}
  .hero .tagline{margin-top:20px;font-size:17px;color:#33405e;max-width:540px}
  .hero .tagline b{color:var(--ai);font-weight:800}
  .typing{margin-top:16px;font-size:15px;color:var(--primary-dark);font-weight:700}
  .typing #rotator{color:var(--ai)}
  .typing .caret{display:inline-block;width:2px;height:1.05em;background:var(--ai);margin-left:2px;vertical-align:-2px;animation:blink 1s steps(1) infinite}
  @keyframes blink{50%{opacity:0}}
  .skills-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin-top:24px}
  .skills-tags span{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--primary-dark);font-weight:700;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:.25s var(--ease)}
  .skills-tags span:hover{transform:translateY(-4px) scale(1.04);box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-color:var(--primary-light)}
  .skills-tags span.ai{color:#fff;border-color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ai),#a78bfa)}
  .hero-actions{margin-top:32px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .btn{border:none;cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;transition:.25s var(--ease);will-change:transform;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}
  .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-dark));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(47,109,246,.4)}
  .btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}
  .btn-ai{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ai),#a78bfa);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(124,92,255,.36)}
  .btn-ai:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}
  .btn-ghost{background:#fff;color:var(--primary);border:1px solid var(--border)}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--bg-soft)}
  .scroll-hint{position:absolute;bottom:20px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);z-index:3;color:var(--primary-dark);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;opacity:.75;animation:bob 1.8s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes bob{50%{transform:translate(-50%,9px)}}

  .hero-right{position:relative;height:460px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .avatar-orbit{position:relative;width:300px;height:300px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:3}
  .avatar-orbit::before{content:"";position:absolute;width:300px;height:300px;border-radius:50%;border:2px dashed rgba(124,92,255,.45);animation:spin 22s linear infinite}
  .avatar-orbit::after{content:"";position:absolute;width:248px;height:248px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid rgba(47,109,246,.3);animation:spin 15s linear infinite reverse}
  @keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}
  .avatar-halo{position:absolute;width:210px;height:210px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(124,92,255,.5),transparent 68%);animation:pulse 3.6s ease-in-out infinite;z-index:1}
  @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:.55}50%{transform:scale(1.15);opacity:.9}}
  .avatar{width:190px;height:190px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;position:relative;z-index:2;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(47,109,246,.45);background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;animation:floaty 5s ease-in-out infinite;border:4px solid #fff}
  @keyframes floaty{50%{transform:translateY(-12px)}}
  .avatar img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
  .avatar-fallback{font-size:74px;font-weight:900;color:#fff}
  .bubbles{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2}
  .bubble{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%,#ffffff,rgba(124,92,255,.22));border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7);box-shadow:inset 0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,.6);animation:floatUp linear infinite}
  @keyframes floatUp{0%{transform:translateY(20px) scale(.9);opacity:0}15%{opacity:.9}100%{transform:translateY(-480px) scale(1.1);opacity:0}}
  .spotlight{position:absolute;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(124,92,255,.16),transparent 70%);pointer-events:none;z-index:2;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);left:50%;top:50%}

  /* ===== Marquee ===== */
  .marquee{overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));padding:14px 0;position:relative;z-index:4}
  .marquee .track{display:flex;gap:38px;width:max-content;animation:scrollX 26s linear infinite}
  .marquee .track span{color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;white-space:nowrap;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:38px}
  .marquee .track span::after{content:"✦";opacity:.7;font-size:12px}
  @keyframes scrollX{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
  .marquee:hover .track{animation-play-state:paused}

  /* ===== Stats ===== */
  #stats{padding:50px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a8a,#2f6df6 60%,#5b3fd6)}
  .stats-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;text-align:center}
  .stat{padding:10px}
  .stat .num{font-size:48px;font-weight:900;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#cfe0ff);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;line-height:1}
  .stat .lbl{font-size:13px;opacity:.9;margin-top:8px;color:#e8efff}

  /* ===== Timeline ===== */
  .timeline{position:relative;margin-top:8px;padding-left:30px}
  .timeline::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:8px;top:6px;bottom:6px;width:3px;background:linear-gradient(var(--primary),var(--ai))}
  .tl-item{position:relative;padding:0 0 32px 28px}
  .tl-item::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:-26px;top:5px;width:17px;height:17px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:4px solid var(--primary);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(47,109,246,.12);transition:.3s}
  .tl-item:hover::before{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(124,92,255,.2);border-color:var(--ai)}
  .tl-item .time{font-size:13px;color:var(--primary-dark);font-weight:800}
  .tl-item h3{font-size:19px;margin:4px 0;font-weight:800}
  .tl-item .org{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:10px}
  .tl-item ul{margin-left:18px;color:#3a4663}
  .tl-item ul li{margin:5px 0;font-size:14.5px}
  .tl-item ul li .ai{color:var(--ai);font-weight:800}

  /* ===== AI banner ===== */
  .ai-banner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ai-soft),#fff);border:1px solid #ddd2ff;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .ai-banner .ic{font-size:28px}
  .ai-banner p{font-size:14.5px;color:#3a2d6b}
  .ai-banner b{color:var(--ai);font-weight:800}

  /* ===== Card base (spotlight + tilt + shine) ===== */
  .card{position:relative;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:box-shadow .3s var(--ease),transform .15s var(--ease),border-color .3s}
  .card::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:inherit;background:radial-gradient(420px circle at var(--mx,50%) var(--my,50%),rgba(124,92,255,.16),transparent 45%);opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;pointer-events:none;z-index:1}
  .card:hover::after{opacity:1}
  .card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow);border-color:var(--primary-light)}
  .card .shine{position:absolute;top:0;left:-60%;width:50%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.55),transparent);transform:skewX(-18deg);transition:none;pointer-events:none;z-index:2;opacity:0}
  .card:hover .shine{animation:shine 1s var(--ease);opacity:1}
  @keyframes shine{0%{left:-60%}100%{left:140%}}

  /* ===== Repo (case study) ===== */
  .repos{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(440px,1fr));gap:24px}
  .repo-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .repo-shot{height:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#2f6df6,#7c5cff);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .repo-shot img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .5s var(--ease)}
  .repo-card:hover .repo-shot img{transform:scale(1.08)}
  .repo-shot .ph{opacity:.92;text-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.2)}
  .repo-head{padding:20px 24px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);position:relative;z-index:3}
  .repo-head .name{font-size:21px;font-weight:900;color:var(--primary-dark);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .repo-head .name .gh{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--ai);background:var(--ai-soft);padding:3px 10px;border-radius:999px}
  .repo-head .desc{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:7px}
  .repo-body{padding:18px 24px 22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;flex:1;position:relative;z-index:3}
  .case-row{display:flex;gap:11px;font-size:14px;align-items:flex-start}
  .case-row .k{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:17px;line-height:1.4}
  .case-row .t{font-weight:800;color:var(--text)}
  .case-row .t .lab{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.5px;color:var(--primary);margin-bottom:1px}
  .case-row .t .lab.ai{color:var(--ai)}
  .case-row .t .lab.win{color:#0ea5e9}
  .repo-tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px}
  .repo-tags span{background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;font-size:12px;color:var(--primary-dark);font-weight:700}
  .repo-links{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:auto;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .repo-links a{padding:10px 17px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:13.5px;transition:.25s var(--ease)}
  .repo-links .src{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-dark));color:#fff}
  .repo-links .src:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-2px)}
  .repo-links .demo{background:#fff;color:var(--ai);border:1px solid #ddd2ff}
  .repo-links .demo:hover{background:var(--ai-soft);transform:translateY(-2px)}

  /* ===== Education ===== */
  .edu-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:18px;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}
  .edu-card{padding:24px}
  .edu-card .school{font-weight:900;font-size:19px;color:var(--primary-dark)}
  .edu-card .major{margin:7px 0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600}
  .edu-card .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  .edu-card .exp{margin-top:12px;font-size:14px;color:#3a4663;border-top:1px dashed var(--border);padding-top:12px}
  .edu-shot{height:150px;margin:-24px -24px 18px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));position:relative}
  .edu-shot img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;transition:transform .5s var(--ease)}
  .edu-card:hover .edu-shot img{transform:scale(1.06)}
  .edu-card > div:not(.edu-shot){position:relative;z-index:3}

  /* ===== Resume modal ===== */
  .modal-mask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,30,55,.5);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);display:none;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;z-index:150;padding:40px 16px;overflow:auto}
  .modal-mask.show{display:flex}
  .modal{background:#fff;border-radius:22px;max-width:740px;width:100%;padding:36px 40px;box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.32);position:relative}
  .modal .close{position:absolute;top:16px;right:20px;border:none;background:var(--bg-soft);width:38px;height:38px;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;font-size:18px;color:var(--muted);transition:.2s}
  .modal .close:hover{background:var(--ai-soft);color:var(--ai)}
  .modal h2{font-size:26px;margin-bottom:2px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;font-weight:900}
  .modal .m-role{color:var(--primary);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:20px;font-size:14px}
  .resume-sec{margin-bottom:18px}
  .resume-sec h4{color:var(--primary-dark);font-size:15px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);padding-left:10px;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:800}
  .resume-sec p,.resume-sec li{font-size:14px;color:#33405e}
  .resume-sec ul{margin-left:18px}
  .modal .download{display:inline-block;margin-top:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));color:#fff;padding:11px 24px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(47,109,246,.3)}

  footer{padding:44px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:#fff}

  @media(max-width:860px){
    .hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .hero-right{height:320px;order:-1}
    .hero h1{font-size:40px}.hero h1 .name{font-size:44px}
    .nav-links{display:none}
    .menu-btn{display:flex}
    .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px 12px}
    .marquee .track{animation-duration:18s}
    .card .shine{display:none}
    .repos{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .edu-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;max-width:100%}
    .timeline{padding-left:22px}
    .tl-item{padding-left:22px}
    .tl-item::before{left:-20px;width:14px;height:14px;border-width:3px}
    section{padding:64px 0}
    .wrap{padding:0 18px}
    .sec-title{font-size:26px}
    .sec-sub{margin-bottom:28px}
    .modal{padding:28px 22px}
    .modal h2{font-size:22px}
  }
  @media(max-width:480px){
    .hero .wrap{padding-top:48px;padding-bottom:40px;min-height:auto}
    .hero-right{height:260px}
    .hero h1{font-size:32px}.hero h1 .name{font-size:36px}
    .hero .tagline{font-size:15px}
    .hero .role,.hero .badge-ai{font-size:13px;padding:6px 13px}
    .avatar-orbit,.avatar-orbit::before{width:230px;height:230px}
    .avatar-orbit::after{width:190px;height:190px}
    .avatar-halo{width:160px;height:160px}
    .avatar{width:140px;height:140px}
    .avatar-fallback{font-size:54px}
    .btn{padding:12px 20px;font-size:14px}
    .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px 8px}
    .stat .num{font-size:36px}
    .stat .lbl{font-size:12px}
    .tl-item h3{font-size:17px}
    .tl-item .org{font-size:13px}
    .tl-item ul li{font-size:13.5px}
    .repo-head .name{font-size:18px}
    .repo-head .desc{font-size:13px}
    .case-row{font-size:13px}
    .repo-tags span{font-size:11px;padding:4px 9px}
    .edu-card{padding:18px}
    .edu-shot{height:130px;margin:-18px -18px 14px}
    .edu-card .school{font-size:17px}
    .edu-card .major{font-size:14px}
    .edu-card .exp{font-size:13px}
    .ai-banner{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;padding:14px 16px}
  }
  @media print{nav,.hero-actions,.marquee,.progress,.cursor-dot,.cursor-ring{display:none}}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}
    .reveal{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important}
    .card::after,.card .shine{display:none!important}
  }

  /* ===== Interview Assistant ===== */
  .iv-section{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .iv-section::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-40px;background:radial-gradient(800px 500px at 10% 0%, rgba(124,92,255,.10), transparent 60%), radial-gradient(700px 400px at 100% 100%, rgba(47,109,246,.10), transparent 60%);z-index:0;pointer-events:none}
  .iv-section .wrap{position:relative;z-index:1}
  .iv-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:42px;align-items:start}
  .iv-left .kicker{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;font-weight:800;color:var(--primary);background:var(--bg-soft);padding:5px 12px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:18px}
  .iv-title{font-size:54px;line-height:1.05;font-weight:900;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:6px 0 16px}
  .iv-title em{font-style:italic;font-weight:900;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff5a5a,#ff8a3d,#ff5a5a);background-size:200% auto;-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;animation:titleFlow 4s linear infinite;display:inline-block;padding:0 4px;margin:0 -4px;position:relative;z-index:1}
  @keyframes titleFlow{to{background-position:200% center}}
  .iv-sub{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:46ch;margin-bottom:14px}
  .iv-hint{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--primary);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:20px;opacity:.92}
  .iv-hint .dotp{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(47,109,246,.5);animation:pulseDot 1.8s infinite}
  @keyframes pulseDot{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(47,109,246,.45)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 8px rgba(47,109,246,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(47,109,246,0)}}
  .iv-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px}
  .chip{padding:9px 14px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--primary);background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;transition:.22s var(--ease);font-family:inherit;position:relative;overflow:hidden;animation:chipIn .5s var(--ease) both;animation-delay:calc(var(--i,0)*55ms)}
  .chip::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-130%;width:55%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(255,255,255,.65),transparent);transform:skewX(-18deg)}
  .chip:hover{background:#fff;border-color:var(--primary);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(47,109,246,.2)}
  .chip:hover::after{animation:chipShine .7s}
  .chip.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));color:#fff;border-color:transparent;box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(47,109,246,.38)}
  .chip:active{transform:translateY(0)}
  @keyframes chipIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px) scale(.96)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  @keyframes chipShine{to{left:140%}}
  .iv-right{min-width:0}
  @property --ang{syntax:'<angle>';initial-value:0deg;inherits:false}
  .chat-card{position:relative;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:560px}
  .chat-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:var(--radius);padding:1.5px;background:conic-gradient(from var(--ang),var(--primary),var(--ai),#38bdf8,var(--primary));-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box,linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-composite:xor;mask-composite:exclude;animation:spinBorder 7s linear infinite;opacity:.55;pointer-events:none}
  @keyframes spinBorder{to{--ang:360deg}}
  .chat-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fafcff,#fff);position:relative;z-index:2}
  .chat-avatar{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai));color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;flex-shrink:0;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(47,109,246,.3);animation:avatarBob 3.2s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes avatarBob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-3px)}}
  .chat-name{font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--text)}
  .chat-status{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:1px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
  .status-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(34,197,94,.5);animation:statusPulse 1.6s infinite}
  @keyframes statusPulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(34,197,94,.5)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(34,197,94,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(34,197,94,0)}}
  .chat-actions{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:6px}
  .chat-btn{padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:.2s}
  .chat-btn:hover{color:var(--primary);border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--bg-soft)}
  .chat-body{flex:1;min-height:0;overflow-y:auto;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;background:#fbfcfe;align-items:flex-start;position:relative}
  .chat-body::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(420px 320px at 18% 0%,rgba(47,109,246,.10),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(380px 300px at 100% 100%,rgba(124,92,255,.10),transparent 60%);background-size:200% 200%;animation:auroraDrift 16s ease-in-out infinite;pointer-events:none;z-index:0}
  @keyframes auroraDrift{0%,100%{background-position:0% 0%,100% 100%}50%{background-position:100% 50%,0% 50%}}
  .chat-body::-webkit-scrollbar{width:6px}
  .chat-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:#cfd8e3;border-radius:3px}
  .msg{position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;animation:msgIn .4s var(--ease) both;width:100%;max-width:100%;min-width:0;flex-shrink:0;box-sizing:border-box}
  .msg-user{flex-direction:row-reverse;margin-left:auto}
  .msg>div:last-child{min-width:0;flex:0 1 auto}
  .msg-av{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;color:#fff;flex-shrink:0}
  .msg-ai .msg-av{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--ai))}
  .msg-user .msg-av{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff8a3d,#ff5a5a)}
  .bubble{max-width:78%;min-width:0;padding:11px 15px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--text);background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px 14px 14px 4px;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(20,40,80,.04);white-space:pre-wrap;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .bubble::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:-150%;width:50%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent,rgba(47,109,246,.10),transparent);animation:bubbleShine 4.5s ease-in-out infinite}
  @keyframes bubbleShine{0%,100%{left:-150%}50%{left:150%}}
  .msg-user .bubble{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-dark));color:#fff;border-color:transparent;border-radius:14px 14px 4px 14px}
  .msg-tag{margin-top:6px;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);padding-left:4px}
  .msg-user .msg-tag{text-align:right;padding-right:4px;padding-left:0}
  .typing-label{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px;padding-left:4px;opacity:.85}
  .chat-typing{display:inline-flex;gap:4px;padding:4px 0}
  .chat-typing span{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--primary);animation:typing 1.2s infinite}
  .chat-typing span:nth-child(2){animation-delay:.2s}
  .chat-typing span:nth-child(3){animation-delay:.4s}
  @keyframes typing{0%,60%,100%{transform:translateY(0);opacity:.4}30%{transform:translateY(-5px);opacity:1}}
  .chat-input{display:flex;gap:8px;padding:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);background:#fff;position:relative;z-index:2}
  .chat-input input{flex:1;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;color:var(--text);background:#fbfcfe;outline:none;transition:.2s}
  .chat-input input:focus{border-color:var(--primary);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(47,109,246,.12)}
  .send-btn{padding:10px 20px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--primary),var(--primary-dark));color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;transition:.2s;box-shadow:0 4px 12px rgba(47,109,246,.32);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .send-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(47,109,246,.42)}
  .send-btn:active{transform:translateY(0)}
  .send-btn .ripple{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.55);transform:scale(0);animation:ripple .6s ease-out;pointer-events:none}
  @keyframes ripple{to{transform:scale(4);opacity:0}}
  @keyframes msgIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px) scale(.97)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  @media (max-width:900px){.iv-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.iv-title{font-size:42px}.chat-card{height:520px}}
  @media (max-width:480px){.iv-title{font-size:34px}.chat-card{height:540px}.chat-body{padding:14px;gap:12px}.bubble{max-width:84%;font-size:13.5px;padding:10px 13px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- scroll progress -->
<div class="progress" id="progress"></div>
<!-- custom cursor -->
<div class="cursor-dot" id="cursorDot"></div>
<div class="cursor-ring" id="cursorRing"></div>

<!-- ===== NAV ===== -->
<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo" onclick="scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})">李焕鹏 · 个人简历</div>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#home">主页</a>
      <a href="#intern">工作经历</a>
      <a href="#repos">开源项目</a>
      <a href="#edu">教育背景</a>
      <a href="#interview">面试助手 <span class="ai-tag">BETA</span></a>
    </div>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="菜单" onclick="toggleMenu()">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</nav>
<div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
  <a href="#home" onclick="toggleMenu()">主页</a>
  <a href="#intern" onclick="toggleMenu()">工作经历</a>
  <a href="#repos" onclick="toggleMenu()">开源项目</a>
  <a href="#edu" onclick="toggleMenu()">教育背景</a>
  <a href="#interview" onclick="toggleMenu()">面试助手 <span class="ai-tag">BETA</span></a>
</div>

<!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
<header class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="grid-overlay"></div>
  <div class="blob b1"></div><div class="blob b2"></div><div class="blob b3"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-left reveal" id="heroLeft">
      <h1>你好，我是<span class="hi name">李焕鹏</span></h1>
      <span class="role">综合管理</span>
      <span class="badge-ai">🚀 已上线 4 个 AI 产品</span>
      <p class="tagline">工程学逻辑 + 一线管理经验 + <b>ChatGPT 深度使用者</b>，并已亲手做出 <b>4 个 AI 产品</b>。专注把 AI 能力<b>落地到真实业务</b>，做应用落地——把大模型真正用进产品。</p>
      <p class="typing">当前聚焦：<span id="rotator"></span><span class="caret"></span></p>
      <div class="skills-tags">
        <span class="ai">AI 工具应用</span><span class="ai">Prompt 工程</span><span class="ai">流程智能化</span>
        <span>数据分析</span><span>培训能力</span><span>机器人 / 编程</span>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)">📍 广东潮州 · 中共党员 · 🟢 GitHub 开源作者</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-primary" id="magneticBtn" onclick="openResume()">📄 一键查看简历</button>
        <a class="btn btn-ai" href="#repos">看我的开源项目 →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-right">
      <div class="avatar-orbit">
        <div class="avatar-halo"></div>
        <div class="avatar">
          <img src="assets/avatar.jpg" alt="李焕鹏" onerror="this.remove()" />
          <span class="avatar-fallback">李</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bubbles" id="bubbles"></div>
      <div class="spotlight" id="spotlight"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">↓ 向下滚动探索</div>
</header>

<!-- ===== MARQUEE ===== -->
<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="track" id="marqueeTrack">
    <span>AI 工具应用</span><span>Prompt 工程</span><span>流程智能化</span><span>Agent 搭建</span>
    <span>大模型应用</span><span>产品思维</span><span>数据分析</span><span>培训能力</span>
    <span>开源项目</span><span>公文自动化</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== STATS ===== -->
<section id="stats" class="stats-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats-grid reveal">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" data-to="4" data-suffix="">0</div><div class="lbl">AI 开源项目</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" data-to="200" data-suffix="+">0</div><div class="lbl">团队管理规模</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" data-to="15" data-suffix="%">0</div><div class="lbl">流程降本</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num" data-to="60" data-suffix="">0</div><div class="lbl">篇宣传稿产出</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== WORK EXPERIENCE ===== -->
<section id="intern">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-title reveal"><span class="dot"></span>工作经历</div>
    <div class="timeline reveal">
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="time">2022.07 – 至今</div>
        <h3>综合管理部负责人 <span class="ai-tag">AI 应用落地</span></h3>
        <div class="org">中国水利水电第六工程局南方公司 · 黄埔红茶项目综合管理部</div>
        <div class="org" style="font-size:13px;opacity:.85;margin-top:3px">助理政工师 · 中共党员 · 2025 年度绩效考核 A ｜ ChatGPT 深度使用者</div>
        <ul>
          <li>AI 行政工作流：用 ChatGPT 等大模型搭建"公文写作 + 数据整理 + 活动策划"行政工作流，沉淀 200+ 可复用 Prompt 模板，常规公文处理效率提升约 300%。</li>
          <li>数据与决策：主导 AI 辅助人力 / 薪酬分析，月度报表从 3 天压缩至 4 小时；统筹约 200 人项目部综合事务，年度间接降本超 50 万元。</li>
          <li>公文与合同：起草处理公文 3000+ 份、合同 200+ 份，AI 模板化使差错率降至 1% 以内<span class="ai">（已把重复性工作半自动化）</span>。</li>
          <li>流程优化：优化采购与会务流程，单项降本约 15%<span class="ai">（系统化思维，契合 AI 产品流程设计）</span>。</li>
          <li>党建与内容：组织主题党日 20+ 次、党员教育 80+ 次，撰写宣传稿 60 篇（省级媒体录用 8 篇）、发表论文 1 篇。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-item">
        <div class="time">2018.07 – 2020.09</div>
        <h3>机器人编程教师</h3>
        <div class="org">深圳市智造家创客教育 · 教育行业</div>
        <ul>
          <li>机器人编程教学：面向 7–16 岁学员讲授机器人逻辑与编程思维，累计带班 30+ 期、学员 500+ 人，竞赛获奖率超 60%。</li>
          <li>课程与培训：独立开发 12 套阶梯式课件，课中管理与课后反馈全流程标准化，学员续报率提升至 85%<span class="ai">（具备把复杂概念讲清楚的培训能力）</span>。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== OPEN SOURCE ===== -->
<section id="repos">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-title reveal"><span class="dot"></span>开源项目<span class="ai-tag">已上线 GitHub</span></div>
    <p class="sec-sub reveal">四个真实动手的 AI 产品 / 开源项目，按「痛点 → 做法 → 结果」拆解，欢迎围观 Star / 提 Issue 🙌</p>
    <div class="repos stagger">
      <div class="repo-card card tilt reveal">
        <div class="repo-shot">
          <img src="assets/gongkao.png" alt="公考私教截图" onerror="this.remove()" />
          <span class="ph">📱 公考私教 · 项目截图</span>
        </div>
        <div class="repo-head">
          <div class="name">📚 公考私教 <span class="gh">gongkao-ai</span></div>
          <div class="desc">公考刷题 / 模考 / 错题复习 + AI 讲解的一体化学习应用</div>
        </div>
        <div class="repo-body">
          <div class="case-row"><span class="k">🎯</span><div class="t"><span class="lab">痛点</span>考生刷题散、错题没人讲、资料繁琐</div></div>
          <div class="case-row"><span class="k">⚙️</span><div class="t"><span class="lab ai">做法</span>Next.js + Capacitor + Agnes AI 搭题库 / 模考 / 错题 AI 讲解 / 百宝箱，Web 与 Android 双端</div></div>
          <div class="case-row"><span class="k">🏆</span><div class="t"><span class="lab win">结果</span>AI 文字 + 漫画分镜讲解，把"自学"变成"有私教带练"</div></div>
          <div class="repo-tags"><span>Next.js</span><span>React</span><span>TypeScript</span><span>Capacitor</span><span>Agnes AI</span></div>
          <div class="repo-links">
            <a class="src" href="https://github.com/huanpeng69-cmyk/gongkao-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">⭐ GitHub 源码</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="repo-card card tilt reveal">
        <div class="repo-shot" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c5cff,#a78bfa)">
          <img src="assets/style.png" alt="颜搭AI截图" style="object-position:top" onerror="this.remove()" />
          <span class="ph">👗 颜搭AI · 项目截图</span>
        </div>
        <div class="repo-head">
          <div class="name">👗 颜搭AI <span class="gh">style-prompt-ui</span></div>
          <div class="desc">面向发型 / 穿搭 / 国风形象 / 电子衣橱的 AI 提示词与方案板工具</div>
        </div>
        <div class="repo-body">
          <div class="case-row"><span class="k">🎯</span><div class="t"><span class="lab">痛点</span>想用 AI 生成穿搭 / 形象图，却不会写提示词、没方案板</div></div>
          <div class="case-row"><span class="k">⚙️</span><div class="t"><span class="lab ai">做法</span>HTML/JS + Node + Wisart API，按场景 / 预算 / 风格出可复制提示词 + 方案板 + 电子衣橱</div></div>
          <div class="case-row"><span class="k">🏆</span><div class="t"><span class="lab win">结果</span>已部署 GitHub Pages 在线预览，含天气建议与购物搜索</div></div>
          <div class="repo-tags"><span>HTML / JS</span><span>Node</span><span>Wisart API</span><span>多端</span></div>
          <div class="repo-links">
